    "Html": "<p>NutritionFacts.org arises from my annual review of the medical literature. With the help of a team of hundreds of volunteers, we churned through tens of thousands of scientific papers published in the peer-reviewed nutrition literature and are ramping up to break new records in 2022. How do I choose which studies to highlight? In general, I strive to focus on the most groundbreaking, interesting, and useful findings, but which topics resonate the most? The practical ones, offering cooking or shopping tips, or those that dissect the studies behind the headlines? Maybe the geeky science ones that explore the wonderfully weird world of human biology are the most popular. As you can see from the below list, the answer is a bit of all of the above.</p>\n<p> </p>\n<p>[container]</p>\n<p>[row]</p>\n<h4><strong>#10 <a href=\"https://nutritionfacts.org/video/dr-greger-in-the-kitchen-cran-chocolate-pomegranate-brol-bowl/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Dr. Greger in the Kitchen: Cran-Chocolate Pomegranate BROL Bowl</a></strong><b></b></h4>\n<p>[/row] [row] [column md=”6″]</p>\n<p>[img fluid=”true”]</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"><a href=\"https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2021/03/Cran-BROL-Thumb.png/\"><img decoding=\"async\" class=\"alignleft wp-image-66888 size-large\" src=\"https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2021/03/Cran-BROL-Thumb-1024x576.png\" alt=\"Cran-Chocolate BROL Bowl\" width=\"356\" height=\"200\" srcset=\"https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2021/03/Cran-BROL-Thumb-1024x576.png 1024w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2021/03/Cran-BROL-Thumb-960x540.png 960w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2021/03/Cran-BROL-Thumb-768x432.png 768w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2021/03/Cran-BROL-Thumb-480x270.png 480w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2021/03/Cran-BROL-Thumb-1200x675.png 1200w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2021/03/Cran-BROL-Thumb-720x405.png 720w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2021/03/Cran-BROL-Thumb-540x304.png 540w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2021/03/Cran-BROL-Thumb.png 1920w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 356px) 100vw, 356px\"/></a></span></p>\n<p> </p>\n<p> </p>\n<p> </p>\n<p> </p>\n<p> </p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">[/img]</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">[/column]</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> [column md=”6″] </span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">I’m sorry this originally came out after pomegranate season ended, but you should be able to find them now! This is one of my favorite ways to eat </span><a href=\"https://nutritionfacts.org/recipe/basic-brol-barley-rye-oats-and-lentils/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">BROL (barley, rye, oats, and lentils)</span></a><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> for breakfast. </span></p>\n<p>[/column]</p>\n<p>[/row]</p>\n<p>[row]</p>\n<p>My Basic BROL—found in <a href=\"https://nutritionfacts.org/book/how-not-to-die-cookbook/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><i>The How Not to Diet Cookbook</i></a>—can be used in all kinds of savory or sweet ways, packing in a lot of prebiotic nutrition and helping to tick off those grain boxes on your Daily Dozen Checklist. For extra credit, sprinkle some matcha on top.</p>\n<p>[/row]</p>\n<p> </p>\n<p>[row]</p>\n<h4><strong>#9 <a href=\"https://nutritionfacts.org/video/kombuchas-side-effects-is-it-bad-for-you/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Kombucha’s Side Effects: Is It Bad for You?</a></strong></h4>\n<p>[/row]</p>\n<p>[row]</p>\n<p>[column md=”6″]</p>\n<p>[img fluid=”true”]</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"><img decoding=\"async\" class=\"alignnone wp-image-84949 size-medium\" src=\"https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2022/01/kombuchas-side-effects-960x540.jpeg\" alt=\"Kombucha’s Side Effects: Is It Bad for You?\" width=\"300\" height=\"169\" srcset=\"https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2022/01/kombuchas-side-effects-960x540.jpeg 960w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2022/01/kombuchas-side-effects-1024x576.jpeg 1024w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2022/01/kombuchas-side-effects-768x432.jpeg 768w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2022/01/kombuchas-side-effects-1536x864.jpeg 1536w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2022/01/kombuchas-side-effects-480x270.jpeg 480w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2022/01/kombuchas-side-effects-1200x675.jpeg 1200w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2022/01/kombuchas-side-effects-720x405.jpeg 720w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2022/01/kombuchas-side-effects-540x304.jpeg 540w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2022/01/kombuchas-side-effects.jpeg 1920w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 300px) 100vw, 300px\"/></span></p>\n<p>[/img]</p>\n<p>[/column]</p>\n<p>[column md=”6″]</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">What are the risks versus benefits of drinking kombucha? I’m glad I was finally able to post an update. *</span><i><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Spoiler Alert</span></i><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">* There are better options. Check out </span><a href=\"https://nutritionfacts.org/video/what-are-the-best-beverages/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">What Are the Best Beverages?</span></a><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">. </span></p>\n<p>[/column]</p>\n<p>[/row]</p>\n<p> </p>\n<p>[row]</p>\n<h4><strong>#8 <a href=\"https://nutritionfacts.org/video/do-angioplasty-heart-stent-procedures-work/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Do Angioplasty Heart Stent Procedures Work?</a></strong></h4>\n<p>[/row]</p>\n<p>[row]</p>\n<p>[column md=”6″][img fluid=”true”]</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"><a href=\"https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2021/01/53-5-Do-Angioplasty-Heart-Stent-Procedures-Work.jpg/\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\" wp-image-66624 alignleft\" src=\"https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2021/01/53-5-Do-Angioplasty-Heart-Stent-Procedures-Work-1024x576.jpg\" alt=\"Do Angioplasty Heart Stent Procedures Work?\" width=\"301\" height=\"169\" srcset=\"https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2021/01/53-5-Do-Angioplasty-Heart-Stent-Procedures-Work-1024x576.jpg 1024w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2021/01/53-5-Do-Angioplasty-Heart-Stent-Procedures-Work-960x540.jpg 960w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2021/01/53-5-Do-Angioplasty-Heart-Stent-Procedures-Work-768x432.jpg 768w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2021/01/53-5-Do-Angioplasty-Heart-Stent-Procedures-Work-480x270.jpg 480w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2021/01/53-5-Do-Angioplasty-Heart-Stent-Procedures-Work-1200x675.jpg 1200w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2021/01/53-5-Do-Angioplasty-Heart-Stent-Procedures-Work-720x405.jpg 720w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2021/01/53-5-Do-Angioplasty-Heart-Stent-Procedures-Work-540x304.jpg 540w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2021/01/53-5-Do-Angioplasty-Heart-Stent-Procedures-Work.jpg 1920w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 301px) 100vw, 301px\"/></a></span></p>\n<p> </p>\n<p> </p>\n<p> </p>\n<p> </p>\n<p>[/img]</p>\n<p>[/column]</p>\n<p>[column md=”6″]</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">This was the first in a controversial seven-part video series documenting how stents perform compared to placebo (fake) surgery. Here are the next six in the series:</span></p>\n<p>[/column]</p>\n<p>[/row]</p>\n<p>[row]</p>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><a href=\"https://nutritionfacts.org/video/why-angioplasty-heart-stents-dont-work-better/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Why Angioplasty Heart Stents Don’t Work Better</span></a></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><a href=\"https://nutritionfacts.org/video/the-risks-of-heart-stents/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">The Risks of Heart Stents</span></a></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><a href=\"https://nutritionfacts.org/video/angioplasty-heart-stent-risks-vs-benefits/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Angioplasty Heart Stent Risks vs. Benefits</span></a></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><a href=\"https://nutritionfacts.org/video/do-heart-stent-procedures-work-for-angina-chest-pain/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Do Heart Stent Procedures Work for Angina Chest Pain?</span></a></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><a href=\"https://nutritionfacts.org/video/why-are-stents-still-used-if-they-dont-work/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Why Are Stents Still Used If They Don’t Work?</span></a></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><a href=\"https://nutritionfacts.org/video/heart-stents-and-upcoding-how-cardiologists-game-the-system/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Heart Stents and Upcoding: How Cardiologists Game the System</span></a><b></b></li>\n</ul>\n<p>[/row]</p>\n<p> </p>\n<p>[row]</p>\n<h4><strong>#7 <a href=\"https://nutritionfacts.org/video/the-scientific-consensus-on-a-healthy-diet/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">The Scientific Consensus on a Healthy Diet</a></strong></h4>\n<p>[/row]</p>\n<p>[row]</p>\n<p>[column md=”6″]</p>\n<p>[img fluid=”true”]</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"><a href=\"https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2021/05/54-09-The-Scientific-Consensus-on-a-Healthy-Diet.jpg/\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"alignleft wp-image-67576 size-large\" src=\"https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2021/05/54-09-The-Scientific-Consensus-on-a-Healthy-Diet-1024x576.jpg\" alt=\"The Scientific Consensus on a Healthy Diet\" width=\"356\" height=\"200\" srcset=\"https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2021/05/54-09-The-Scientific-Consensus-on-a-Healthy-Diet-1024x576.jpg 1024w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2021/05/54-09-The-Scientific-Consensus-on-a-Healthy-Diet-960x540.jpg 960w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2021/05/54-09-The-Scientific-Consensus-on-a-Healthy-Diet-768x432.jpg 768w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2021/05/54-09-The-Scientific-Consensus-on-a-Healthy-Diet-480x270.jpg 480w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2021/05/54-09-The-Scientific-Consensus-on-a-Healthy-Diet-1200x675.jpg 1200w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2021/05/54-09-The-Scientific-Consensus-on-a-Healthy-Diet-720x405.jpg 720w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2021/05/54-09-The-Scientific-Consensus-on-a-Healthy-Diet-540x304.jpg 540w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2021/05/54-09-The-Scientific-Consensus-on-a-Healthy-Diet.jpg 1920w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 356px) 100vw, 356px\"/></a></span></p>\n<p> </p>\n<p> </p>\n<p> </p>\n<p> </p>\n<p> </p>\n<p>[/img]</p>\n<p>[/column]</p>\n<p>[column md=”6″]</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Tragically, the leading risk factor for death in the United States is the American diet</span><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">—b</span><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">ut that means we have the power to change it! The media likes to inflate the controversies, but the science has been clear for decades about the core tenets of healthy eating and living.</span></p>\n<p>[/column]</p>\n<p>[/row]</p>\n<p> </p>\n<p>[row]</p>\n<h4><b>#6 <a href=\"https://nutritionfacts.org/video/are-beyond-meat-and-the-impossible-burger-healthy/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Are Beyond Meat and the Impossible Burger Healthy?</a></b></h4>\n<p>[/row]</p>\n<p>[row]</p>\n<p>[column md=”6″]</p>\n<p>[img fluid=”true”]</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"><a href=\"https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2020/10/52-19-Are-Beyond-Meat-and-the-Impossible-Burger-Healthy_.jpg/\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"alignleft wp-image-65827 size-large\" src=\"https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2020/10/52-19-Are-Beyond-Meat-and-the-Impossible-Burger-Healthy_-1024x576.jpg\" alt=\"Are Beyond Meat and the Impossible Burger Healthy?\" width=\"356\" height=\"200\" srcset=\"https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2020/10/52-19-Are-Beyond-Meat-and-the-Impossible-Burger-Healthy_-1024x576.jpg 1024w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2020/10/52-19-Are-Beyond-Meat-and-the-Impossible-Burger-Healthy_-960x540.jpg 960w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2020/10/52-19-Are-Beyond-Meat-and-the-Impossible-Burger-Healthy_-768x432.jpg 768w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2020/10/52-19-Are-Beyond-Meat-and-the-Impossible-Burger-Healthy_-480x270.jpg 480w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2020/10/52-19-Are-Beyond-Meat-and-the-Impossible-Burger-Healthy_-1200x675.jpg 1200w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2020/10/52-19-Are-Beyond-Meat-and-the-Impossible-Burger-Healthy_-720x405.jpg 720w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2020/10/52-19-Are-Beyond-Meat-and-the-Impossible-Burger-Healthy_-540x304.jpg 540w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2020/10/52-19-Are-Beyond-Meat-and-the-Impossible-Burger-Healthy_.jpg 1920w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 356px) 100vw, 356px\"/></a></span></p>\n<p> </p>\n<p> </p>\n<p> </p>\n<p> </p>\n<p> </p>\n<p>[/img]</p>\n<p>[/column]</p>\n<p>[column md=”6″]</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">That was a common question during my monthly Q&amp;As so I did a deep dive and created a nine-video series on the topic, including:</span></p>\n<p>[/column]</p>\n<p>[/row]</p>\n<p>[row]</p>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><a href=\"https://nutritionfacts.org/video/the-environmental-impacts-of-plant-based-meat-substitutes/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">The Environmental Impacts of Plant-Based Meat Substitutes</span></a></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><a href=\"https://nutritionfacts.org/video/plant-based-protein-are-pea-and-soy-protein-isolates-harmful/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Are Pea and Soy Protein Isolates Harmful?</span></a></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><a href=\"https://nutritionfacts.org/video/plant-based-meat-substitutes-put-to-the-test/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Plant-Based Meat Substitutes Put to the Test</span></a></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><a href=\"https://nutritionfacts.org/video/the-health-effects-of-mycoprotein-quorn-products/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">The Health Effects of Mycoprotein (Quorn) Products vs BCAAs in Meat</span></a></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><a href=\"https://nutritionfacts.org/video/what-about-the-heme-in-impossible-burgers/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">What About the Heme in Impossible Burgers?</span></a></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><a href=\"https://nutritionfacts.org/video/does-heme-iron-cause-cancer/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Does Heme Iron Cause Cancer?</span></a></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><a href=\"https://nutritionfacts.org/video/heme-induced-n-nitroso-compounds-and-fat-oxidation/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Heme-Induced N-Nitroso Compounds and Fat Oxidation</span></a></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><a href=\"https://nutritionfacts.org/video/is-heme-iron-the-reason-meat-is-carcinogenic/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Is Heme Iron the Reason Meat Is Carcinogenic?</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n<p>[/row]</p>\n<p>[row]</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">For a healthful, whole-food veggie burger, check out my recipe for </span><a href=\"https://nutritionfacts.org/recipe/black-bean-burger/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Black Bean Burgers</span></a><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> from my first </span><a href=\"https://nutritionfacts.org/book/how-not-to-die-cookbook/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">cookbook</span></a><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">.</span></p>\n<p>[/row]</p>\n<p> </p>\n<p>[row]</p>\n<h4><strong>#5 <a href=\"https://nutritionfacts.org/video/are-doctors-misleading-patients-about-statin-risks-and-benefits/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Are Doctors Misleading Patients About Statin Risks and Benefits?</a></strong></h4>\n<p>[/row]</p>\n<p>[row]</p>\n<p>[column md=”6″]</p>\n<p>[img fluid=”true”]</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"><a href=\"https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2021/07/54-24-Are-Doctors-Misleading-Patients-About-Statin-Risks-and-Benefits.jpg/\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"alignleft wp-image-68149 size-large\" src=\"https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2021/07/54-24-Are-Doctors-Misleading-Patients-About-Statin-Risks-and-Benefits-1024x576.jpg\" alt=\"Are Doctors Misleading Patients About Statin Risks and Benefits?\" width=\"356\" height=\"200\" srcset=\"https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2021/07/54-24-Are-Doctors-Misleading-Patients-About-Statin-Risks-and-Benefits-1024x576.jpg 1024w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2021/07/54-24-Are-Doctors-Misleading-Patients-About-Statin-Risks-and-Benefits-960x540.jpg 960w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2021/07/54-24-Are-Doctors-Misleading-Patients-About-Statin-Risks-and-Benefits-768x432.jpg 768w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2021/07/54-24-Are-Doctors-Misleading-Patients-About-Statin-Risks-and-Benefits-480x270.jpg 480w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2021/07/54-24-Are-Doctors-Misleading-Patients-About-Statin-Risks-and-Benefits-1200x675.jpg 1200w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2021/07/54-24-Are-Doctors-Misleading-Patients-About-Statin-Risks-and-Benefits-720x405.jpg 720w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2021/07/54-24-Are-Doctors-Misleading-Patients-About-Statin-Risks-and-Benefits-540x304.jpg 540w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2021/07/54-24-Are-Doctors-Misleading-Patients-About-Statin-Risks-and-Benefits.jpg 1920w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 356px) 100vw, 356px\"/></a></span></p>\n<p> </p>\n<p> </p>\n<p> </p>\n<p> </p>\n<p> </p>\n<p>[/img]</p>\n<p>[/column]</p>\n<p>[column md=”6″]</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">What is the dirty little secret of drugs for lifestyle diseases? If patients knew the truth of how little these drugs actually worked, almost no one would agree to take them. This was part of a four-part series on statins, which includes:</span></p>\n<p>[/column]</p>\n<p>[/row]</p>\n<p>[row]</p>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><a href=\"https://nutritionfacts.org/video/who-should-take-statins/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Who Should Take Statins?</span></a></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><a href=\"https://nutritionfacts.org/video/the-true-benefits-vs-side-effects-of-statins/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">The True Benefits vs. Side Effects of Statins</span></a><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> </span></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><a href=\"https://nutritionfacts.org/video/how-much-longer-do-you-live-on-statins/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">How Much Longer Do You Live on Statins?</span></a><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> </span></li>\n</ul>\n<p>[/row]</p>\n<p>[row]</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Another popular video of 2021 was </span><a href=\"https://nutritionfacts.org/video/how-low-should-you-go-for-ideal-cholesterol-levels/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">How Low Should You Go for Ideal Cholesterol Levels?</span></a><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">. I explore how h</span><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">aving a so-called normal cholesterol in a society where it’s normal to drop dead of a heart attack isn’t necessarily a good thing.</span></p>\n<p>[/row]</p>\n<p> </p>\n<p>[row]</p>\n<h4><strong>#4 <a href=\"https://nutritionfacts.org/video/the-best-diet-for-hypothyroidism-and-hyperthyroidism/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">The Best Diet for Hypothyroidism and Hyperthyroidism</a></strong></h4>\n<p>[/row]</p>\n<p>[row]</p>\n<p>[column md=”6″]</p>\n<p>[img fluid=”true”]</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"><a href=\"https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2021/01/53-25-The-Best-Diet-for-Hypothyroidism-and-Hyperthyroidism.jpg/\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"alignleft wp-image-66750 size-large\" src=\"https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2021/01/53-25-The-Best-Diet-for-Hypothyroidism-and-Hyperthyroidism-1024x576.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"356\" height=\"200\" srcset=\"https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2021/01/53-25-The-Best-Diet-for-Hypothyroidism-and-Hyperthyroidism-1024x576.jpg 1024w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2021/01/53-25-The-Best-Diet-for-Hypothyroidism-and-Hyperthyroidism-960x540.jpg 960w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2021/01/53-25-The-Best-Diet-for-Hypothyroidism-and-Hyperthyroidism-768x432.jpg 768w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2021/01/53-25-The-Best-Diet-for-Hypothyroidism-and-Hyperthyroidism-480x270.jpg 480w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2021/01/53-25-The-Best-Diet-for-Hypothyroidism-and-Hyperthyroidism-1200x675.jpg 1200w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2021/01/53-25-The-Best-Diet-for-Hypothyroidism-and-Hyperthyroidism-720x405.jpg 720w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2021/01/53-25-The-Best-Diet-for-Hypothyroidism-and-Hyperthyroidism-540x304.jpg 540w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2021/01/53-25-The-Best-Diet-for-Hypothyroidism-and-Hyperthyroidism.jpg 1920w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 356px) 100vw, 356px\"/></a></span></p>\n<p> </p>\n<p> </p>\n<p> </p>\n<p> </p>\n<p> </p>\n<p>[/img]</p>\n<p>[/column]</p>\n<p>[column md=”6″]</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Thyroid health is another topic I got asked about a lot. In this video, I explore whether the apparent protection of plant-based diets for thyroid health is due to the exclusion of animal foods, the benefits of plant foods, or both. The other three videos in this series are:</span></p>\n<p>[/column]</p>\n<p>[/row]</p>\n<p>[row]</p>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><a href=\"https://nutritionfacts.org/video/are-vegans-at-risk-for-iodine-deficiency/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Are Vegans at Risk for Iodine Deficiency?</span></a><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> </span></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><a href=\"https://nutritionfacts.org/video/the-healthiest-natural-source-of-iodine/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">The Healthiest Natural Source of Iodine</span></a></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><a href=\"https://nutritionfacts.org/video/diet-for-hypothyroidism-a-natural-treatment-for-hashimotos-disease/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Diet for Hypothyroidism: A Natural Treatment for Hashimoto’s Disease</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n<p>[/row]</p>\n<p>[row]</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">One common cause of an underactive thyroid is autoimmune thyroiditis. Another popular video from this past year explores one tool for dealing with this friendly fire: </span><a href=\"https://nutritionfacts.org/video/fasting-for-autoimmune-diseases/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Fasting for Autoimmune Diseases</span></a><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">. See our </span><a href=\"https://nutritionfacts.org/topics/fasting/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">fasting topic page</span></a><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> for even more.</span></p>\n<p>[/row]</p>\n<p> </p>\n<p>[row]</p>\n<h4><b>#3 <a href=\"https://nutritionfacts.org/video/the-best-diet-for-fatty-liver-disease-treatment/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">The Best Diet for Fatty Liver Disease Treatment</a></b></h4>\n<p>[/row]</p>\n<p>[row]</p>\n<p>[column md=”6″]</p>\n<p>[img fluid=”true”]</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"><a href=\"https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2021/01/53-13-The-Best-Diet-for-Fatty-Liver-Disease-Treatment.jpg/\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"alignleft wp-image-66666 size-large\" src=\"https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2021/01/53-13-The-Best-Diet-for-Fatty-Liver-Disease-Treatment-1024x576.jpg\" alt=\"The Best Diet for Fatty Liver Disease Treatment\" width=\"356\" height=\"200\" srcset=\"https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2021/01/53-13-The-Best-Diet-for-Fatty-Liver-Disease-Treatment-1024x576.jpg 1024w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2021/01/53-13-The-Best-Diet-for-Fatty-Liver-Disease-Treatment-960x540.jpg 960w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2021/01/53-13-The-Best-Diet-for-Fatty-Liver-Disease-Treatment-768x432.jpg 768w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2021/01/53-13-The-Best-Diet-for-Fatty-Liver-Disease-Treatment-480x270.jpg 480w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2021/01/53-13-The-Best-Diet-for-Fatty-Liver-Disease-Treatment-1200x675.jpg 1200w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2021/01/53-13-The-Best-Diet-for-Fatty-Liver-Disease-Treatment-720x405.jpg 720w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2021/01/53-13-The-Best-Diet-for-Fatty-Liver-Disease-Treatment-540x304.jpg 540w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2021/01/53-13-The-Best-Diet-for-Fatty-Liver-Disease-Treatment.jpg 1920w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 356px) 100vw, 356px\"/></a></span></p>\n<p> </p>\n<p> </p>\n<p> </p>\n<p> </p>\n<p> </p>\n<p>[/img]</p>\n<p>[/column]</p>\n<p>[column md=”6″]</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Nonalcoholic fatty liver is now a leading cause of liver failure. In this video, I address the three sources of liver fat and how you can get rid of it.</span></p>\n<p>[/column]</p>\n<p>[/row]</p>\n<p> </p>\n<p>[row]</p>\n<h4><strong>#2 <a href=\"https://nutritionfacts.org/video/200-pound-weight-loss-without-hunger/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">200-Pound Weight Loss Without Hunger</a></strong><b></b></h4>\n<p>[/row]</p>\n<p>[row]</p>\n<p>[column md=”6″]</p>\n<p>[img fluid=”true”]</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"><a href=\"https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2021/06/54-15-200-Pound-Weight-Loss-Without-Hunger.jpg/\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"alignleft wp-image-67960 size-large\" src=\"https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2021/06/54-15-200-Pound-Weight-Loss-Without-Hunger-1024x576.jpg\" alt=\"200-Pound Weight Loss Without Hunger\" width=\"356\" height=\"200\" srcset=\"https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2021/06/54-15-200-Pound-Weight-Loss-Without-Hunger-1024x576.jpg 1024w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2021/06/54-15-200-Pound-Weight-Loss-Without-Hunger-960x540.jpg 960w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2021/06/54-15-200-Pound-Weight-Loss-Without-Hunger-768x432.jpg 768w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2021/06/54-15-200-Pound-Weight-Loss-Without-Hunger-480x270.jpg 480w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2021/06/54-15-200-Pound-Weight-Loss-Without-Hunger-1200x675.jpg 1200w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2021/06/54-15-200-Pound-Weight-Loss-Without-Hunger-720x405.jpg 720w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2021/06/54-15-200-Pound-Weight-Loss-Without-Hunger-540x304.jpg 540w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2021/06/54-15-200-Pound-Weight-Loss-Without-Hunger.jpg 1920w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 356px) 100vw, 356px\"/></a></span></p>\n<p> </p>\n<p> </p>\n<p> </p>\n<p> </p>\n<p> </p>\n<p>[/img]</p>\n<p>[/column]</p>\n<p>[column md=”6″]</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">I’m excited people found this video as fascinating as I did. If you aren’t blown away by the eye-opening revelations, you may want to watch it a second time to fully absorb it all.</span></p>\n<p>[/column]</p>\n<p>[/row]</p>\n<p>[row]</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">For more on healthy weight loss, check out my </span><a href=\"https://nutritionfacts.org/video/evidence-based-weight-loss-live-presentation/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Evidence-Based Weight Loss</span></a><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> presentation and my book </span><a href=\"https://nutritionfacts.org/book/how-not-to-diet/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><i><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">How Not to Diet</span></i></a><i><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">. </span></i><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">(All proceeds from my books are donated to charity.)</span></p>\n<p>[/row]</p>\n<p> </p>\n<p>[row]</p>\n<h4><b>#1 <a href=\"https://nutritionfacts.org/video/what-causes-cancer-to-metastasize/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">What Causes Cancer to Metastasize?</a></b></h4>\n<p>[/row]</p>\n<p>[row]</p>\n<p>[column md=”6″]</p>\n<p>[img fluid=”true”]</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"><a href=\"https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2021/05/54-02-What-Causes-Cancer-to-Metastasize.jpg/\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"alignleft wp-image-67453 size-large\" src=\"https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2021/05/54-02-What-Causes-Cancer-to-Metastasize-1024x576.jpg\" alt=\"What Causes Cancer to Metastasize?\" width=\"356\" height=\"200\" srcset=\"https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2021/05/54-02-What-Causes-Cancer-to-Metastasize-1024x576.jpg 1024w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2021/05/54-02-What-Causes-Cancer-to-Metastasize-960x540.jpg 960w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2021/05/54-02-What-Causes-Cancer-to-Metastasize-768x432.jpg 768w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2021/05/54-02-What-Causes-Cancer-to-Metastasize-480x270.jpg 480w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2021/05/54-02-What-Causes-Cancer-to-Metastasize-1200x675.jpg 1200w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2021/05/54-02-What-Causes-Cancer-to-Metastasize-720x405.jpg 720w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2021/05/54-02-What-Causes-Cancer-to-Metastasize-540x304.jpg 540w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2021/05/54-02-What-Causes-Cancer-to-Metastasize.jpg 1920w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 356px) 100vw, 356px\"/></a></span></p>\n<p> </p>\n<p> </p>\n<p> </p>\n<p> </p>\n<p> </p>\n<p>[/img]</p>\n<p>[/column]</p>\n<p>[column md=”6″]</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">One of the reasons I love my work so much is that I love learning. That’s the first thrill. The second is being able to share the knowledge. In this video, I discussed that palmitic acid, a saturated fat concentrated in meat and dairy, can boost the metastatic potential of cancer cells through the fat receptor CD36. </span></p>\n<p>[/column]</p>\n<p>[/row]</p>\n<p>[row]</p>\n<p>I had never even heard of CD36 until recently! I followed this video with <a href=\"https://nutritionfacts.org/video/how-to-help-control-cancer-metastasis-with-diet/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">How to Help Control Cancer Metastasis with Diet</a> and <a href=\"https://nutritionfacts.org/video/the-food-that-can-downregulate-a-metastatic-cancer-gene/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">The Food That Can Downregulate the Metastatic Cancer Gene</a>. I can’t wait to find out what I’m going to learn next year!</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Speaking of discoveries, check out another popular video from this year, </span><a href=\"https://nutritionfacts.org/video/boosting-anticancer-immunity-with-forest-bathing/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Boosting Anticancer Immunity with Forest Bathing</span></a><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">. </span><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Visiting a forest can induce a significant increase in both the number and activity of natural killer cells, one of the ways our body fights off cancer. But why? The big reveal is in the follow-up: </span><a href=\"https://nutritionfacts.org/video/why-does-forest-bathing-boost-natural-killer-cell-function/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Why Does Forest Bathing Boost Natural Killer Cell Function?</span></a><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">.</span></p>\n<p>[/row]</p>\n<p> </p>\n<h4><b>Join the New Plant-Based Living Email Series</b></h4>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"><a href=\"https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2022/01/Plant-Based-Living-Web-Square.jpg/\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"alignleft wp-image-71180 size-large\" src=\"https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2022/01/Plant-Based-Living-Web-Square-1024x1024.jpg\" alt=\"Plant-based living series illustration\" width=\"200\" height=\"200\" srcset=\"https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2022/01/Plant-Based-Living-Web-Square-1024x1024.jpg 1024w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2022/01/Plant-Based-Living-Web-Square-960x960.jpg 960w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2022/01/Plant-Based-Living-Web-Square-768x768.jpg 768w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2022/01/Plant-Based-Living-Web-Square-500x500.jpg 500w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2022/01/Plant-Based-Living-Web-Square-720x720.jpg 720w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2022/01/Plant-Based-Living-Web-Square-540x540.jpg 540w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2022/01/Plant-Based-Living-Web-Square.jpg 1080w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 200px) 100vw, 200px\"/></a></span><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Our new ten-week email series is a free resource to bring you simple takeaways and actionable tips on healthy eating. Whether you’re new to a whole food, plant-based lifestyle or would benefit from reminders on some of the key aspects of healthy evidence-based nutrition, this series is for you. Based on our popular </span><a href=\"https://nutritionfacts.org/healthkit/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><i><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Evidence-Based Eating Guide</span></i></a><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">, a weekly email with even more tips and information will be delivered straight to your inbox. <a href=\"https://nutritionfacts.org/plantbased-living-series/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Click here</a> to see the full list of topics and to sign up.</span></p>\n<p>[/container]</p>\n<p> </p>\n<p>In health,<br/>\n<b>Michael Greger, M.D.</b></p>\n<p>PS: If you haven’t yet, you can subscribe to my free videos <a href=\"https://nutritionfacts.org/subscribe/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><b>here</b></a><b> </b>and watch my live, year-in-review presentations:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>2019: <a href=\"https://nutritionfacts.org/video/evidence-based-weight-loss-live-presentation/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><b>Evidence-Based Weight Loss</b></a></li>\n<li>2016: <a href=\"https://nutritionfacts.org/video/how-not-to-die/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><b>How Not To Die: The Role of Diet in Preventing, Arresting, and Reversing Our Top 15 Killers</b></a></li>\n<li>2015: <a href=\"https://nutritionfacts.org/video/food-as-medicine/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><b>Food as Medicine: Preventing and Treating the Most Dreaded Diseases with Diet</b></a></li>\n<li>2014: <a href=\"https://nutritionfacts.org/video/from-table-to-able/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><b>From Table to Able: Combating Disabling Diseases with Food</b></a></li>\n<li>2013: <a href=\"https://nutritionfacts.org/video/more-than-an-apple-a-day-preventing-our-most-common-diseases/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><b>More Than an Apple a Day</b></a></li>\n<li>2012: <a href=\"https://nutritionfacts.org/video/uprooting-the-leading-causes-of-death/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><b>Uprooting the Leading Causes of Death</b></a></li>\n</ul>"
  }
}
